# Normalise line endings for everyone.
#
# Files are stored in the repo with LF. Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true were
# rewriting them to CRLF on disk, which then failed `pnpm format:check` locally because
# .prettierrc.json pins "endOfLine": "lf" — while CI (ubuntu-latest) passed, since
# autocrlf does not apply there. Pinning eol=lf here makes Windows, macOS, Linux and CI
# all agree, regardless of each developer's local git config.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip  binary
